# Roo Code Rules
# (Mirrors .clinerules)

## Tech Stack Overview
- **Vite 8** + **React 19**
- **Tailwind CSS v4** + PostCSS
- **Three.js** (WebGL 3D background in Hero)
- **Framer Motion 13** (Spring physics, scroll reveal, accordion animations)
- **Oxlint** (Fast JavaScript/JSX linter)
- **AAS (Agentic Awesome Skills)**: Comprehensive local skill library with 2,980+ specialized agent skills in `.agent/skills/skills/`.

